# Official Receita Federal engines (MIT), pinned to a release tag and run unmodified (ADR 001, ADR 004).
# The SHA is the commit the tag points to; CI checks out the SHA and fails if the tag moved.
# Bump tag and SHA together (MOT-01.4 automates this).
